  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Crop Trust is an international non-profit organization dedicated to conserving and making crop diversity available for use globally, forever and for the benefit of everyone. It was established in 2004 by the Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (FAO) and Bioversity International on behalf of the CGIAR. Ireland currently sits on its Donor Council (last meeting held in Brasilia in June 2024, Patrick McManus attended).</narrative>
